# LifeFlow's API root, with the version. The Careers pages read job openings
# from it (on the server) and the apply form posts applications to it (from the
# browser), so LifeFlow's CAREERS_SITE_ORIGIN must list this site's origin.
# Unset = the Careers page shows no openings.
NEXT_PUBLIC_LIFEFLOW_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1

# Optional. Must equal LifeFlow's CAREERS_REVALIDATE_SECRET: LifeFlow sends it to
# /api/careers/revalidate after HR changes a job, so the Careers pages refresh
# straight away. Server-only, never prefix it with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Unset = the route refuses every call and job changes wait for the 5-minute timer.
CAREERS_REVALIDATE_SECRET=
